<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - First Marine - (built 1979) 22,531 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $4 million.</p>
<p>Newbuilding - 9,732 dwt delivery January 1997 sold to Malaysian buyers for $13 million.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Star Trader - (built 1980) 2,710 dwt sold within Norway for $3.4 million with three years timecharter.</p>
<p>COMBINATION CARRIER - Monterey - (built 1974) sold to Indian buyers fo $3.25 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final.</p>
</text>
